hey guys and gals gigantic here with  just a quick update to video so one  question i get asked quite often by you  guys is if a website would ask me to  join them and pay me to make videos for  them would i accept it and for the most  part i've said no i've had a few  requests from websites to join them  already but i've always refused because  these reviews are my hobby and i always  wanted it to stay that way i never  intended to do any of these reviews for  money or get pressured to make reviews  on a schedule because i wouldn't enjoy  as much and that would obviously cause a  dip in my quality so in my mind the only  way i would accept anyone paying me to  do these videos is if one i would be  able to stay on youtube so i wouldn't  have to leave all you guys behind two i  could continue doing my videos the way i  wanted without having to compromise on  my style and three i can make reviews at  my own pace like i am now with no  pressure to keep on a schedule that's  when my only real options would be  either the youtube partnership program  which was out the question since i used  so much copyrighted clips that they  wouldn't touch me or some anime company  allowing me to use their clips and  paying me to do these videos which was a  highly unlikely and stupid thought so  imagine my shock when stars media who if  you don't know owned the anime  distribution company manga entertainment  contacted me and asked if i would join  their network where they would help  monetize my account and help give me  free advertising and in the future allow  me to gain access to their anime clips  without having to worry about copyright  to which i said hell the [ __ ] yes so  yeah  that happens a big thank you to stars  media manga entertainment for picking me  up and letting me do what i do for you  guys while being able to stay on youtube  anyway with that announcement out of the  way let's talk about new videos and the  future of this channel recently i  haven't had the time to work on new  videos since i had to put all my efforts  to catching up on university stuff after  i worked overtime to finish the  countdown for you guys but i actually  have a few new reviews scripted out to  finish when i get the chance but here's  the thing in the future i want to try  and stray away from being purely a  reviewer which is why if you haven't  noticed i've been experimenting with  different concepts recently for example  my rants were just a way for me to bring  out discussions and get the community  involved while also giving a chance to  let some of you guys get some exposure  which is why i feature a video response  after every rant and to my surprise has  got an overwhelmingly positive response  in fact they're getting more views than  my reviews are it also seems like you  also liked my amv and countdown as well  so i'll probably do more of them too but  don't worry i don't intend to stop  reviewing it's just that if i put a bit  of a variety into my work it might  motivate me to work more on videos  rather than releasing a new review every  two or three months or god forbid taking  another eight-month break like i used to  do because i was burned out plus at the  end of the day i wanted to become a  channel for entertainment about anime  topics in general rather than just a  purely reviewing channel so i hope you  guys don't mind me experimenting with  new concepts now and then but just so  you know that whatever i do my end goal  is to entertain you guys in one way or  another oh and before i forget during my  last live stream a few of you tried to  convince me to make a facebook fan page  since not everyone is a twitter user  which are finally gone and done so link  to that is in the description below as  well and any major announcements will go  on there along with on my twitter i  think that's all for now thank you all  for sticking with me especially those of  you who made it through my epic  countdown keep commenting and subbing  them if you still haven't posted a video  response to my dub haters rants well you  better do so soon because my new rant is  coming up but until then i'll see you  all next time
 

